WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
If your prep is SuTab, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:03.920
it.

3
00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.320
Just follow along step by step. Your SuTab kit includes two bottles of 12

4
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:08.880
tablets each

5
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:13.700
and a measured container. Start your first dose between 6 and 7 p.m. the night

6
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.560
before your procedure.

7
00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:19.800
Open your first bottle of 12 tablets. Fill the provided container with 16

8
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:20.560
ounces of water up

9
00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:25.120
to the fill line. Swallow one tablet every two minutes with a sip of water,

10
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:25.920
finishing all 12

11
00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:30.560
tablets over about 15 to 20 minutes. Take your time and go at a steady pace.

12
00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:32.400
About one hour

13
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.530
after your last tablet, fill the container again with 16 ounces of water and

14
00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:37.760
drink the entire amount

15
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:43.010
slowly over 30 minutes. Then, about 30 minutes after finishing that container,

16
00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:43.680
fill it one more

17
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.180
time with 16 ounces of water and drink the entire amount over 30 minutes. That

18
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:49.520
completes your first dose.

19
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:56.450
Repeat the exact same three steps using your second bottle of 12 tablets. One

20
00:00:56.450 --> 00:00:57.040
tablet every

21
00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.860
two minutes with water, then 16 ounces of water one hour later, then 16 ounces

22
00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.040
of water 30 minutes

23
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.560
after that. This part is really important. You must drink all of the prep

24
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.360
solution as directed,

25
00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:14.080
even if you're already passing clear liquid. I know it can feel like enough,

26
00:01:14.080 --> 00:01:14.800
but finishing the

27
00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.560
entire dose is what gives us the clearest view during your procedure. If the

28
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:19.680
prep isn't completed

29
00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:24.080
as directed, we may need to reschedule, and neither of us wants that. Between

30
00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:24.720
doses,

31
00:01:24.720 --> 00:01:28.480
keep drinking clear liquids to stay hydrated. It will help you feel better and

32
00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.120
help the prep do

33
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:33.250
its job. Do not drink anything at all within four hours of your procedure,

34
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:34.320
including water,

35
00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.720
unless it is a small sip to take a medication. Your procedure may be canceled

36
00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:39.680
or rescheduled

37
00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:43.440
if this is not followed. If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips

38
00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:44.480
to the bathroom,

39
00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:48.880
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That

40
00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:51.040
's it. You've got this.

41
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:56.400
Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any

42
00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.440
questions at all,

43
00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:00.880
don't hesitate to call our office. We're here to help.
